  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Eight Heads — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>One of your ancestors devoured Yamata no Orochi, the Eight Headed Serpent, creating a hereditary technique with its power.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you have the ability to come back to life after you die, up to 8 times. When you are reduced to 0 hit points or die outright, you can spend 1 CE to come back to life at half your hitpoint maximum and harmful conditions other than exhaustion are removed. You have 8 lives and can use a life this way three times per long rest. This increases to four at 3rd level and eight at 6th level.  You regain one expended life after eight days.</p>",
